{"series":{"id":"against-god","slug":"against-god","title":"Against God","image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-04/Site-community-image.jpg?itok=xG-3y78d","synopsis":"Conocida como contra los dioses. La historia se centrará en nuestro protagonista Yun Che, quien posee la sangre del dios malvado y se embarcará en un viaje contra el cielo. Nuestro prota en su primera vida perdió a sus seres queridos y murió con el remordimiento de no poderlos vengar en su totalidad, pero este, tuvo la fortuna de contar con la perla del veneno celestial, la cual le dio una segunda vida como Xiao Che y le permitió empezar de nuevo. Aún con el defecto de tener la vena mística dañada, nuestro prota emprenderá su camino por repararla y evitar que el flujo del destino se repita","status":"En Emisión","year":2023,"genres":[],"type":"donghua","src":"donghualife","sourceUrls":["https://donghualife.com/series/against-god"],"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T17:20:12.573Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"against-god-t2","slug":"against-god-t2","seriesId":"against-god","number":2,"image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-04/Site-community-image.jpg?itok=xG-3y78d","updatedAt":"2026-09-19T17:20:12.573Z","episodeCount":25}],"episodes":[{"id":"against-god-t2-e24","slug":"against-god-t2-e24","title":"against-god-2-episodio-x24","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/episode/against-god-2-episodio-x24","servers":[{"name":"rumble.com","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5x9q/?pub=4m2typ","embed":true},{"name":"geo.dailymotion.com","url":"https://geo.dailymotion.com/player.html?video=k43CHVtQQEr1g2JLdmS","embed":true}],"seriesId":"against-god","seasonId":"against-god-t2","number":24,"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T17:23:14.335Z"},{"id":"against-god-t2-e23","slug":"against-god-t2-e23","title":"against-god-2-episodio-x23","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/episode/against-god-2-episodio-x23","servers":[{"name":"rumble.com","url":"https://rumble.com/embe